# MiuiCamera fetches its Panorama, Movie and other modes from Xiaomi's CDN on
# first use as Qigsaw splits (every entry in assets/qigsaw_5.0.0.0_2.0.json
# has builtIn false), unpacks them into its own data directory and dlopens
# their native libraries from there. It is platform-signed here, and
# platform_app may not execute from its data directory, so the load fails
# with "couldn't map ... Permission denied", Qigsaw deletes the split and
# exits, and the download looks as if it never finishes.
#
# Stock's plat_sepolicy grants platform_app exactly these two rules. The W^X
# neverallow covers all_untrusted_apps only.
allow platform_app app_data_file:file { getattr map execute execute_no_trans };
allow platform_app privapp_data_file:file { read getattr map execute open };
